SUMMARY:Get ready: 2028 general election in 120 days
DESCRIPTION:On the ballot:\n- City: Phoenix mayor and odd-numbered council 
 districts (expected\, not yet official)\n- School district: School board s
 eats and any district bond or override measures (expected\, not yet offici
 al)\n- County: County offices in every county (supervisors\, recorder\, sh
 eriff\, county attorney\, assessor\, treasurer\, school superintendent)\n-
  State: All 90 state legislature seats\n- State: Three Corporation Commiss
 ion seats\n- State: Statewide ballot measures\, if any qualify (expected\,
  not yet official)\n- Federal: President\n- Federal: U.S. Senate (the seat
  Mark Kelly holds)\n- Federal: All nine U.S. House seats\nSee your exact b
 allot at https://my.arizona.vote\n\nTap the link to check your address\, s
 ee your ballot\, and make a plan.\nhttps://chatgpt.com/g/REPLACE-WITH-YOUR
